    <label xlink:type="resource" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/documentation" xlink:label="disclosures_BalanceSheet_lbl" xml:lang="en">A balance sheet, also known as the statement of financial condition, summarizes the status of an economic entity.</label>

